<h1 data-copy-en="Tinker" data-copy-zh="Tinker">Tinker</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Follow Tinker’s events, conversations and dates, and check when her lab and Fortress services are available." data-copy-zh="按顺序推进 Tinker 的事件、谈心与约会，并查清实验室和要塞服务的开放时间。">Follow Tinker’s events, conversations and dates, and check when her lab and Fortress services are available.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Tinker at a glance</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Lab and evening schedule</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Personal events and conversations</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Visits, lessons and services</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If progression stops</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">先认识 Tinker</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">实验室与晚班</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">个人事件与谈心顺序</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">日常相处、学习与服务</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">推进停住时</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">接下来可以查阅</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts_and_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Visible_Repairs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Open_Chassis"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Factory_Reset"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Artificial_Nature_Date_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Artificial_Nature_Date_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recharge_Station_Date_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recharge_Station_Date_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>Tinker at a glance</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Tinker — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinker.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Tinker — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinker.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Tinker — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Tinker is the enhancement artisan at the <strong>Human Performance Optimization Lab</strong> in the Future Fringe Zone. Her route includes eleven personal events, three Heart-to-Hearts, two dates, lessons and two one-time stat rewards. This guide gives the next steps without explaining the discoveries inside those scenes.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stats_and_Changing_Schedule"></span><h2>Lab and evening schedule</h2><p>Initially she is at the <strong>Human Performance Optimization Lab all day</strong>. Enter for Second Opinions. After <strong>I Have Hands</strong>, she works at the lab <strong>00:00–17:59</strong> and <strong>Fortress → Engineering,18:00–23:59</strong>.</p><p>The evening Engineering menu has Talk, Jewelry and Robot Bar Date. Return to her lab portrait before 18:00 for lessons, rewards and Heart-to-Hearts.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Personal_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Later_Shared_Story_Appearances"></span><h2>Personal events and conversations</h2><p>Complete the automatic events in order, returning to the listed room at the right time. Each row requires the previous personal event; extra main-story and hacking requirements are shown separately.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Personal event</th><th scope="col">Relationship at least</th><th scope="col">Arrival</th><th scope="col">Extra gate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Second Opinions</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 00:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Organic, Synthetic, Partial, Rebuilt</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Body Argues Back</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Built for the Job</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intended to Survive</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Warranty Fraud</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Protocol Graveyard</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">Story 15; Enhancement Center hacked</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Blessed on Paper</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Neutrality Has Teeth</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">I Have Hands</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Human Performance Optimization Lab 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">Story 35; No Factory Reset</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Chosen Architecture</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Intimate (1600)</td><td data-label="Arrival">Engineering 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Extra gate">—</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Start the three Heart-to-Hearts yourself, in this order: <strong>Visible Repairs → Open Chassis → No Factory Reset</strong>. Their gates and costs are below. The final conversation is required before I Have Hands; the dates are optional.</p><p>After the main story, a shared follow-up can occur at the Robot Bar. Its scene outcome is left to the game.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Actions,_Lessons_and_One-Time_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Actions.2C_Lessons_and_One-Time_Rewards"></span><h2>Visits, lessons and services</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost / allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Tinker</th><td data-label="Requirements">Five/day; base affection 1</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">15 min</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Requirements">Known; one Jewelry; once/day; base 9</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">10 min</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cybernetics</th><td data-label="Requirements">Known; Technology 26; full version</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">150 min; $250; 30 Energy; 30 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Time-Tech Integration</th><td data-label="Requirements">Crush; Intelligence 30; full version</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">300 min; $750; 80 Energy; 70 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Modification Aesthetics</th><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance; Technology 35; +1 Attractiveness; once</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">30 min</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reversible Retrofit</th><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend; Technology 45; The Protocol Graveyard; Enhancement Center hacked; +1 Ability; once</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">60 min; 20 Energy; 10 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Visible Repairs</th><td data-label="Requirements">Friend; The Body Argues Back; once</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">75 min; 15 Energy; +5 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Open Chassis</th><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend; Warranty Fraud; Visible Repairs; once</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">90 min; 20 Energy; 10 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Factory Reset</th><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic; Neutrality Has Teeth; Open Chassis; once</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">90 min; 20 Energy; 15 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Artificial Nature Date</th><td data-label="Requirements">Friend; 08:00–17:59; once</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">120 min; $50; 25 Energy; +10 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Robot Bar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements">Crush; 18:00–23:59; once</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">120 min; $100; 20 Energy; +10 Calm</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk and Jewelry allowances are shared between her two work locations. Her preferred stats are Technology 85, Intelligence 75 and Creativity 70; Fashion improves affection gains. Body-modification tracks have their own menus and costs; see the maintained guide.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>If progression stops</h2><ul><li><strong>No Protocol Graveyard:</strong> finish Warranty Fraud and Story 15, complete the Enhancement Center hack, reach Close Friend, then enter the lab after 18:00.</li><li><strong>No I Have Hands:</strong> finish Neutrality Has Teeth, No Factory Reset and Story 35; enter the lab 08:00–17:59 at Romantic or higher.</li><li><strong>She left the lab:</strong> after that event, find her at Engineering in the evening. Earlier lab services remain available during the day.</li><li><strong>A lesson disappeared:</strong> learned skills are removed from her teaching menu.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-body-modifications.html">Body modifications — workshop and upgrades</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army — recruitment and equipment</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story — current objective</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — stages and bonuses</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts_and_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Visible_Repairs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Open_Chassis"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Factory_Reset"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Artificial_Nature_Date_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Artificial_Nature_Date_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recharge_Station_Date_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recharge_Station_Date_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>先认识 Tinker</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Tinker 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinker.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Tinker 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/tinker.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Tinker 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Tinker 是未来边缘区<strong>人类表现优化实验室</strong>的改造技师。她有十一段个人事件、三段谈心、两场约会、技能教学与两项一次性属性奖励。这里说明推进条件，事件中的发现留到游戏中体验。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stats_and_Changing_Schedule"></span><h2>实验室与晚班</h2><p>最初她<strong>全天都在人类表现优化实验室</strong>，进门即可开始介绍事件。完成<strong>《我有双手》</strong>后，白天<strong>00:00–17:59</strong>仍在实验室，晚上<strong>18:00–23:59</strong>改到<strong>要塞的工程室（身体改造界面称「要塞工程部」）</strong>。</p><p>工程室的个人菜单有交谈、赠送珠宝与机器人酒吧约会。技能教学、属性交流和谈心，请在 18:00 前回实验室找她。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Personal_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Later_Shared_Story_Appearances"></span><h2>个人事件与谈心顺序</h2><p>个人事件按表中顺序，在合适时段进入对应房间时自动开始。每一步都要先完成上一段；额外主线与入侵条件另列在最后一栏。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">个人事件</th><th scope="col">最低关系阶段</th><th scope="col">地点与进入时段</th><th scope="col">额外条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">第二诊断意见</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 00:00–23:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">有机体、合成体、混合体、重构体</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">已遇见（Acknowledged，10）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">身体提出异议</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为这份工作而造</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">相识（Acquaintance，50）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为生存而设计</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">保修欺诈</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">协议墓地</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">主线第 15 节；已入侵强化中心</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">纸面上的赐福</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中立也有利齿</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我有双手</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">人类表现优化实验室 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">主线第 35 节；已完成「拒绝恢复出厂设置」</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">自主构型</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">亲密（Intimate，1600）</td><td data-label="地点与进入时段">工程室 18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="额外条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table><p>三段谈心要主动选择，顺序为<strong>「显露的修补」→「敞开的机体」→「拒绝恢复出厂设置」</strong>。最后一段是《我有双手》的前置，两场约会可以自行安排。</p><p>主线结束后，在机器人酒吧还可遇到一段共同后续，具体内容留待游玩。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Actions,_Lessons_and_One-Time_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Actions.2C_Lessons_and_One-Time_Rewards"></span><h2>日常相处、学习与服务</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与 Tinker 交谈</th><td data-label="条件">每天五次；基础好感 1</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">15 分钟</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="条件">已知；1 珠宝；每天一次；基础好感 9</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">10 分钟</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">控制论</th><td data-label="条件">已知；科技 26；完整版</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">150 分钟；财富 250；30 精力；30 镇定</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">时间科技整合</th><td data-label="条件">迷恋；智力 30；完整版</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">300 分钟；财富 750；80 精力；70 镇定</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">改造美学</th><td data-label="条件">相识；科技 35；吸引力 +1；一次</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">30 分钟</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">可逆改造</th><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友；科技 45；已完成协议墓地并入侵强化中心；能力 +1；一次</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">60 分钟；20 精力；10 镇定</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">显露的修补</th><td data-label="条件">朋友；已完成身体提出异议；一次</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">75 分钟；15 精力；+5 镇定</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">敞开的机体</th><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友；已完成保修欺诈与显露的修补；一次</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">90 分钟；20 精力；10 镇定</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">拒绝恢复出厂设置</th><td data-label="条件">浪漫感；已完成中立也有利齿与敞开的机体；一次</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">90 分钟；20 精力；15 镇定</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">人工自然约会</th><td data-label="条件">朋友；08:00–17:59；一次</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">120 分钟；财富 50；25 精力；+10 镇定</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">机器人酒吧约会</th><td data-label="条件">迷恋；18:00–23:59；一次</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">120 分钟；财富 100；20 精力；+10 镇定</td></tr></tbody></table><p>两处工作地点的交谈与赠礼次数共用。她偏好的属性是<strong>科技 85、智力 75、创造力 70</strong>，学会<strong>时尚</strong>也能提高好感收益。身体改造另有菜单与升级费用，请查阅对应系统指南。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>推进停住时</h2><ul><li><strong>没有协议墓地：</strong>完成保修欺诈、主线第 15 节与强化中心入侵，达到亲密朋友后，18:00 以后进实验室。</li><li><strong>没有《我有双手》：</strong>先完成前一段个人事件、最后一段谈心与主线第 35 节，达到浪漫感后，在 08:00–17:59 进入实验室。</li><li><strong>晚上找不到她：</strong>完成该事件后，晚上到工程室找她；较早的实验室服务仍可白天使用。</li><li><strong>教学选项消失：</strong>已经学会的技能不会继续显示在教学菜单中。</li></ul></section>
